ACTIVITY UC11 — Manage Audio Files
PARTITION actor = {Admin, WebCMS*, Backend}

START                                          @Admin
[Navigate to Audio Files section (/admin/audio)] @Admin
[Select target artifact & language]            @Admin
[Choose audio file from disk (MP3/WAV <= 30MB)] @Admin
[Dispatch POST /api/uploads/audio]             @WebCMS
IF (File format valid and <= 30MB?) THEN
    [Save file to /uploads/audio & return URL] @Backend
    [Audition audio & author SubtitleCue timeline] @Admin
    [Save updates via PUT /api/artifacts/:id]  @Backend
ELSE
    [Display invalid format or file size error] @WebCMS
FINAL
